WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
From appraisal files to a clear, evidence-led review.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Upload MISMO XML and supporting PDFs. Group multiple appraisals in one batch.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Rules and AI surface missing support, inconsistencies, and items requiring review.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Inspect the supporting page, review the finding, and record the next action.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Map sales and rental comps. Compare proximity, prices, rents, and property size.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Research exact property listings, sale history, and available photos for discrepancies.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Balance model capability, reasoning effort, and processing speed against cost.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Document resolutions, work through the checklist, and export PDF or Excel outputs.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.000
AppraisalIQ brings the appraisal, comparables, and review workflow together.
